sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Customer
    participant App as PhonePe app with<br/>NPCI Common Library
    participant PSP as PSP bank<br/>@ybl handle
    participant NPCI as NPCI switch
    participant Rem as Remitter bank<br/>HDFC
    participant Ben as Beneficiary bank<br/>SBI
    participant Merch as Chai stall<br/>QR sticker

    Note over User,Merch: One-time setup, done once per device
    App->>PSP: Device binding: send SMS from<br/>the SIM tied to the account
    PSP->>NPCI: ReqListAccount for that mobile number
    NPCI->>Rem: Fetch linked accounts
    Rem-->>NPCI: Masked account list
    NPCI-->>App: RespListAccount
    User->>App: Set UPI PIN using debit card<br/>last 6 digits plus expiry
    App->>NPCI: ReqSetCre, PIN encrypted by<br/>Common Library with NPCI public key

    Note over User,Merch: The payment, 5 seconds end to end
    User->>Merch: Scan static QR<br/>encodes merchant VPA
    App->>App: Parse VPA: chaiwala@paytm
    App->>PSP: ReqValAdd, validate address
    PSP->>NPCI: Resolve VPA
    NPCI->>NPCI: Mapper lookup
    NPCI-->>PSP: Registered name "RAMESH TEA STALL"
    PSP-->>App: Show name and amount
    User->>App: Enter 40 rupees, confirm

    User->>App: Enter 4 or 6 digit UPI PIN
    Note over App: Common Library encrypts the PIN.<br/>PhonePe's own code never reads it.
    App->>PSP: Credential block plus<br/>hash of amount, refId, payer, payee, device
    PSP->>NPCI: ReqPay

    NPCI->>NPCI: Velocity and limit checks
    NPCI->>Rem: Debit request with credential block
    Rem->>Rem: Decrypt and verify PIN<br/>2FA complete: device + PIN
    Rem->>Rem: Balance check, debit 40 rupees
    Rem-->>NPCI: Debit success

    NPCI->>Ben: Credit request
    Ben->>Ben: Credit merchant account
    Ben-->>NPCI: Credit success

    NPCI-->>PSP: RespPay success
    PSP-->>App: Success
    App-->>User: "Paid 40 to Ramesh Tea Stall"
    Ben->>Merch: Soundbox announces<br/>"Forty rupees received"

    alt Credit leg fails after debit
        Ben-->>NPCI: Credit declined
        NPCI->>Rem: Reversal
        Rem->>Rem: Auto-reverse debit
        Note over Rem: If not reversed within the<br/>scheme window, penalty applies
    end

    Note over NPCI,Ben: Money moved on the books instantly.<br/>Interbank settlement happens later<br/>on a net basis at the RBI.
